# Build output and caches. Only the keycloak builder stage uses this file. proxy/Dockerfile has its own
# proxy/Dockerfile.dockerignore.
# Excluding these also avoids "creating tar gz: lstat ...: no such file or directory" errors when another
# build (e.g. the jib build of workspace-manager) modifies them while Docker creates the context archive.
/.intellijPlatform
**/.gradle
/node_modules
**/build
**/node_modules
/dashboard/dist
**/.kotlin
/.claude
